+# The scroll bar rule of the sidebars. buildSheet() writes every row of the
+# map as one custom property of the root, so no row of the map can carry that
+# rule and no run above reads it. The check below runs the writer over the
+# slider keys, the pointer key and the groove keys of the settings.
+add_custom_command(TARGET qtcurve-firefox-theme POST_BUILD
